  "id": "need-for-power",
  "term": "need for power",
  "definition": "Need for power is a motivation to have influence or impact, especially in leadership. It can be expressed in a dominant, self-serving way aimed at status and personal gain, or in a prosocial way focused on guiding, helping, and empowering others for the common good.",
